{"suttaId":"thag12.1","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2520,2556],"vripara":"608"},"segments":{"thag12.1:0.4":"Sīlavattheragāthā","thag12.1:1.1":"“Sīlamevidha sikkhetha, asmiṃ loke susikkhitaṃ;","thag12.1:1.3":"Sīlaṃ hi sabbasampattiṃ, upanāmeti sevitaṃ.","thag12.1:2.1":"“Sīlaṃ rakkheyya medhāvī, patthayāno tayo sukhe;","thag12.1:2.3":"Pasaṃsaṃ vittilābhañca, pecca sagge pamodanaṃ [pecca sagge ca modanaṃ (sī. pī.)].","thag12.1:3.1":"“Sīlavā hi bahū mitte, saññamenādhigacchati;","thag12.1:3.3":"Dussīlo pana mittehi, dhaṃsate pāpamācaraṃ.","thag12.1:4.1":"“Avaṇṇañca akittiñca, dussīlo labhate naro;","thag12.1:4.3":"Vaṇṇaṃ kittiṃ pasaṃsañca, sadā labhati sīlavā.","thag12.1:5.1":"“Ādi sīlaṃ patiṭṭhā ca, kalyāṇānañca mātukaṃ;","thag12.1:5.3":"Pamukhaṃ sabbadhammānaṃ, tasmā sīlaṃ visodhaye.","thag12.1:6.1":"“Velā ca saṃvaraṃ sīlaṃ [saṃvaro sīlaṃ (sī.), saṃvarasīlaṃ (sī. aṭṭha.)], cittassa abhihāsanaṃ;","thag12.1:6.3":"Titthañca sabbabuddhānaṃ, tasmā sīlaṃ visodhaye.","thag12.1:7.1":"“Sīlaṃ balaṃ appaṭimaṃ, sīlaṃ āvudhamuttamaṃ;","thag12.1:7.3":"Sīlamābharaṇaṃ seṭṭhaṃ, sīlaṃ kavacamabbhutaṃ.","thag12.1:8.1":"“Sīlaṃ setu mahesakkho, sīlaṃ gandho anuttaro;","thag12.1:8.3":"Sīlaṃ vilepanaṃ seṭṭhaṃ, yena vāti disodisaṃ.","thag12.1:9.1":"“Sīlaṃ sambalamevaggaṃ, sīlaṃ pātheyyamuttamaṃ;","thag12.1:9.3":"Sīlaṃ seṭṭho ativāho, yena yāti disodisaṃ.","thag12.1:10.1":"“Idheva nindaṃ labhati, peccāpāye ca dummano;","thag12.1:10.3":"Sabbattha dummano bālo, sīlesu asamāhito.","thag12.1:11.1":"“Idheva kittiṃ labhati, pecca sagge ca summano;","thag12.1:11.3":"Sabbattha sumano dhīro, sīlesu susamāhito.","thag12.1:12.1":"“Sīlameva idha aggaṃ, paññavā pana uttamo;","thag12.1:12.3":"Manussesu ca devesu, sīlapaññāṇato jayan”ti.","thag12.1:12.5":"… Sīlavo thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
